Now, don't Hildy me. You're gonna let him out, or aren't you?

00:39:33.410 --> 00:39:34.490
No. I never stole...

00:39:34.490 --> 00:39:35.670
Oh, Bruce, please. All right, you're not.

00:39:36.020 --> 00:39:37.400
Well, perhaps you'd better read the post in the morning.

00:39:37.740 --> 00:39:40.160
I can't imagine who'd do a thing like that to me.

00:39:40.320 --> 00:39:41.880
I can't think of any enemies I have.

00:39:42.100 --> 00:39:43.900
I'm sure you haven't any... Have you got the check?

00:39:44.060 --> 00:39:45.180
Oh, yes. I have it right here.

00:39:46.400 --> 00:39:49.160
That's a funny superstition you newspaper people have.

00:39:49.360 --> 00:39:49.940
Yes, isn't it?

00:39:51.180 --> 00:39:55.440
About being arrested at first, I thought maybe Walter Burns might have something to do with it.

00:39:55.540 --> 00:39:57.890
But then, of course, I realized he couldn't have.

00:39:58.300 --> 00:39:58.620
Why?

00:39:58.990 --> 00:39:59.970
Well, he's a very nice...

00:40:00.440 --> 00:40:02.020
Oh, yes, I found that out.

00:40:02.760 --> 00:40:03.280
What's the matter?

00:40:03.790 --> 00:40:04.690
I've lost my wallet.

00:40:05.680 --> 00:40:05.920
Yes.

00:40:06.720 --> 00:40:07.820
Well, Bruce, never mind.

00:40:07.940 --> 00:40:08.400
I have the money.

00:40:08.580 --> 00:40:09.560
You better give me the check, too.

00:40:10.030 --> 00:40:11.850
And that picture of us in Bermuda.

00:40:11.950 --> 00:40:12.630
Don't bother, Bruce.

00:40:12.750 --> 00:40:14.110
You'll find lots of things missing.

00:40:17.560 --> 00:40:18.580
Bruce, do you wait here?

00:40:18.890 --> 00:40:20.090
I'm not taking any more chances.

00:40:20.250 --> 00:40:20.950
I'll be down in three minutes.

00:40:20.990 --> 00:40:21.830
We're taking the next train.

00:40:22.880 --> 00:40:29.840
And so into this little tortured mine came the idea that that gun had been produced for use.

00:40:30.220 --> 00:40:37.440
and use it he did but the state has a production for use plan two it has a gallows and at 7 a.m unless

00:40:37.440 --> 00:40:41.880
a miracle occurs that gallows will be used to separate the soul of earl williams from his body

00:40:41.880 --> 00:40:49.100
and out of molly malloy's life will go the one kindly soul she ever knew that's as far as she got

00:40:49.100 --> 00:40:54.410
but i ask you guys can that girl write an interview she'll do when somebody else comes along i don't

00:40:54.410 --> 00:40:58.480
think it's very ethical reading other people's stuff where do you get that ethic stuff you're

00:40:58.480 --> 00:40:59.920
You're the only one who'll swipe any of it.

