Now I give that marriage three months and I'm laying three to one. Any takers?

00:41:09.520 --> 00:41:10.220
I'll take that bet.

00:41:10.820 --> 00:41:13.700
Hey, it's getting so a girl can't leave the room without being disgusted by a bunch of old ladies.

00:41:14.330 --> 00:41:16.790
Hello, Post. Hey, get me Walter Perns, will you please?

00:41:17.010 --> 00:41:21.030
Oh, don't get sore, Hildy. We were only saying a swell reporter like you wouldn't quit so easy.

00:41:21.390 --> 00:41:24.700
This is Hildy Johnson. Oh, I can quit, all right, without a single quiver.

00:41:25.240 --> 00:41:27.080
I'm going to live like a human being, not like you, chumps.

00:41:27.860 --> 00:41:29.880
Is that you, Walter? Oh, I've got some news for you.

00:41:30.350 --> 00:41:32.970
Yes, yes, I got the end of you all right, but I've got some more important news.

00:41:33.580 --> 00:41:35.100
Perhaps you'd better get a pencil and take it down.

00:41:35.820 --> 00:41:39.680
Already? Now get this, you double-crossing chimpanzee.

00:41:39.800 --> 00:41:41.820
There ain't going to be any interview and there ain't going to be any story.

00:41:42.300 --> 00:41:44.240
And that certified check of yours is leaving with me in 20 minutes.

00:41:44.380 --> 00:41:46.620
I wouldn't cover the burning of room for you if they were just lighting it up.

00:41:46.800 --> 00:41:49.060
And if I ever lay my two eyes on you again, I'm going to walk right up to you

00:41:49.060 --> 00:41:51.620
and hammer on that monkey skull of yours till it rings like a Chinese gong.

00:41:52.240 --> 00:41:53.740
Oh, so you don't know why I'm angry with you.

00:41:54.100 --> 00:41:55.920
Well, perhaps you'd better get Louie to tell you the story of his watch.

00:41:56.020 --> 00:41:57.560
And there's just one other little thing I want you to listen to.

00:42:02.450 --> 00:42:03.690
