00:42:08.220 --> 00:42:09.620
It's all in little pieces now, Alder.

00:42:09.780 --> 00:42:11.100
And I hope to do the same for you someday.

00:42:11.920 --> 00:42:14.300
And that, my friends, is my farewell to the newspaper game.

00:42:14.360 --> 00:42:15.860
I'm gonna be a woman, not a newsgetting machine.

00:42:16.160 --> 00:42:17.640
I'm gonna have babies and take care of them...

00:42:17.640 --> 00:42:19.420
and give them cod liver oil and watch their teeth grow.

00:42:20.060 --> 00:42:22.480
And, oh, dear, if I ever see one of them look at a newspaper again...

00:42:22.480 --> 00:42:23.740
I'm gonna brain them. Where's my hat?

