Well, Murth... Send us a postcard.

00:43:37.400 --> 00:43:37.980
Goodbye, Hildy.

00:43:38.360 --> 00:43:40.380
So long, Janssen. When we see you again, Janssen.

00:43:40.500 --> 00:43:42.800
Next time you see me, I should be riding in a Rolls-Royce,

00:43:42.820 --> 00:43:44.060
giving interviews on success.

00:43:44.520 --> 00:43:46.020
So long, you wage slaves.

00:43:46.240 --> 00:43:46.840
Bye, Hildy.

